4,Agwagwune - yay (Niger-Congo) - PeopleGroups.org,https://peoplegroups.org/language/yay/,"Agwagwune (yay) is part of the Niger-Congo family and Niger-Congo, Atlantic-Congo, Volta-Congo, Benue-Congo, Cross River, Delta Cross, Upper Cross, Central, North-South, Ubaghara-Kohumono, Kohumono class.",Agwagwune,Niger-Congo
